21.NOV.13
TO: CCA, CCE, CCB, NSG, WSG, USG, ASG
FM: CDA
RE: [SQM: about New lanes] YR2014 Yearly Sales QTA Establishing - Day2

Dear RHQ recipients,
if you have not yet decided which office will have loading and contract QTA for the new lanes,
we recommend you to leave current actived status of RHQ-Office relation setting.

And when you finally confirm which offices will have QTA, then you can fix active status in this screen.
Then newly actived office will be shown in "Planning" step screen also.
By the way, since new lanes can not have initial portion data of RHQ-Office level, you need to input their
RHQ-Office level portion manually when you do "Planning" Step.

******************************************* Original message **********************************************

Dear recipients,
we appreciate your (Head office & RHQs) supports yesterday, so we can move on to Day2 work today.

[cid:E5A8.jpg@12345678.87654321]


For day2, only RHQ's QTA PICs needs to finish "Lane-Office Relation Setting" menu.
Basically, this screen has initial data for both Loading & Contract office view by using previous QTA's data.
So first please check existing data. And if there are any offices need to be marked as active or inactive,
please fix and save those offices of each lane in the screen for both Loading & Contract office view.


[cid:EBD6.jpg@12345678.87654321]

And there are few lanes which will be added in year2014.
So please check this new lanes' RHQ-Office relation active & inactive also.

*** New Lanes ***
1. PN3TP // 2. PDNAE, PDNTP // 3. PDSAE, PDSTP // AWPTP


Lastly, let us know your ID if you are the QTA PIC and you still don't have access right to SQM.
And feel free to contact us anytime if you have any question about this work & other QTA related things.
Please refer detail work guidance by downloading below linked files.

:)



*Links: User Guidance (HO & RHQ respectively)

        => Head Office Link (Click here for downloading HO Guudance)<http://mail.hanjin.com/pds/pds_url_pre_download.jsp?key=NTI4NDhiNDczZmUwNDAzYjU5NGUyY2Vj&lang=kor>

        => RHQ (Click here for downloading RHQ Guudance)<http://mail.hanjin.com/pds/pds_url_pre_download.jsp?key=NTI4NDhiNjkzZmRkOWYwNWM4MDgzMWI4&lang=kor>


-End-

